{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Aru Asa Dummy Head Mic ni Natteita Ore-kun no Jinsei","The slapstick comedy revolves around a protagonist who was reincarnated into a dummy head microphone (a microphone embedded in a fake human head to faithfully record the aural ambience). That dummy head microphone happens to be used by Yuri and other high school girls in an ASMR club, who have their sights set on the \"ASMR Koushien\" high school championships. (ASMR or Autonomous Sensory Meridian Response is the nerve-tingling or relaxing sensation one gets in response to stimuli such as certain sounds or sights.)\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ある朝ダミーヘッドマイクになっていた俺クンの人生",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-52381","ids":{"shikimori":52381,"mal":52381,"anilist":152207,"kodik":"serial-46912"},"kodikIds":["serial-46342","serial-46379","serial-46912"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-46342":"2022-12-28T16:52:51Z","serial-46379":"2023-01-05T19:05:15Z","serial-46912":"2022-11-11T22:19:36Z"},"title":"Моя жизнь после того, как однажды утром я стал микрофоном в голове манекена","originalTitle":"Yuri no Aida ni Hasamareru. Aru Asa Dummy Head Mike ni Natte Ita Ore-kun no Jinsei","alt":"Aru Asa Dummy Head Mic ni Natteita Ore-kun no Jinsei / Aru Asa Dummy Head Mike ni Natteita Ore-kun no Jinsei / My Life After I Became a Dummy Head Mic One Morning, ある朝ダミーヘッドマイクになっていた俺クンの人生","description":"После перерождения в бинауральный микрофон-манекен главный герой оказывается втянут в жизнь старшеклассниц, увлечённых ASMR. Эта комедийная история расскажет о том, как школьницы стремятся покорить «ASMR Кошиэн».","year":2022,"type":"TV","genres":["Повседневность","реинкарнация"],"rating":4.98,"popularity":7961,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/52381/487cf6a41e7e376c590af385e2c8a961.jpeg","width":685,"height":975},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/0b8d7d8a63153f5c9251ca3